tatistics"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"PLC / SCADA Awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Technical Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Pharma Industry Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the candidate should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain pharmaceutical manufacturing processes"},{"text":"Understand GMP principles"},{"text":"Understand equipment qualification"},{"text":"Explain IQ/OQ/PQ"},{"text":"Understand process validation"},{"text":"Identify CPPs and CQAs"},{"text":"Understand cleaning-validation principles"},{"text":"Understand HVAC and utility qualification"},{"text":"Understand computerized system validation concepts"},{"text":"Perform basic risk assessments"},{"text":"Understand FMEA"},{"text":"Understand deviations and CAPA"},{"text":"Understand change control"},{"text":"Apply data-integrity principles"},{"text":"Analyze process data statistically"},{"text":"Use Excel confidently"},{"text":"Understand PLC/SCADA fundamentals"},{"text":"Write structured validation protocols"},{"text":"Prepare validation reports"},{"text":"Understand traceability"},{"text":"Complete a pharmaceutical manufacturing/validation internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest entry-level profile is not simply \"pharmaceutical engineering graduate.\" The candidate should demonstrate the ability to connect engineering systems with GMP and documented validation evidence."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pharmaceutical Engineering","GMP","Equipment Qualification","IQ/OQ/PQ","Process Validation","Cleaning Validation","Risk Management","Data Integrity","Statistics","Technical Documentation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For modern manufacturing environments, add:"},{"type":"flow","items":["CSV","PLC/SCA